# A core that makes a link call from a save right after a load: from frame
# 40 console 0's retro_serialize sends when its state hash is not the copy
# that each retro_run keeps and no load refreshes. A new process has no
# copy, so the from run passes; a load into the running session leaves the
# copy of frame 59, and a save before the next retro_run sends.
# error: console 0 made a link call while its state was saved right after the load
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_mode stale_send
option 0 link_test_bad_frame 40
0 cable 0:0 1:0
30 save mid
60 end
